     "Greetings,<div><br></div><div>The UW-Madison <a href=\"http://chtc.cs.wisc.edu\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://chtc.cs.wisc.edu&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244211887000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2wemHdHtpr9JYty_BXObVs\">Center for High Throughput Computing</a> (CHTC) and the <a href=\"https://www.opensciencegrid.org/bin/view\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.opensciencegrid.org/bin/view&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244211887000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2dm35xijs1XoiYh3YGeswc\">Open Science Grid</a> (OSG) are in the early stages of developing a software package for R, and to inform this product, we are looking for R programmers of all skill levels to interview on Thursday, August 8 (next week). Please contact me (below) if you may be interested, and spread to the word to other R users. These 30-45 minute interviews will be conducted in the Wisconsin Institutes for Discovery, so we are focusing on interviewing UW-affiliated individuals who work on campus, but that&#39;s not a &quot;rule&quot; by any means. </div><div><br></div><div>&#39;Take this opportunity to inform an academically-developed and open-source product! Those who contribute their time will have the opportunity to use/test the software at various stages before it is released.</div><div><br></div><div>Best Wishes,</div><div>Lauren Michael</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px\"><font color=\"#999999\">----------------------------------------</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px\"><font color=\"#999999\">Lauren A. Michael</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px\"><font color=\"#999999\">Research Computing Facilitator</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px\"><a href=\"http://aci.wisc.edu/\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://aci.wisc.edu/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244211887000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1n9jnpwMNacNuj5nm1MRBp\"><font color=\"#990000\">Advanced Computing Infrastructure</font></a><font color=\"#999999\">,</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px\"><a href=\"http://chtc.cs.wisc.edu/\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://chtc.cs.wisc.edu/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244211887000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1LzcDxGhyJVQCfpR23p-4I\"><font color=\"#990000\">Center for High Throughput Computing</font></a><font color=\"#999999\">, and</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px\"><a href=\"http://wid.wisc.edu/research/cct/\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://wid.wisc.edu/research/cct/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244211887000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2IvMz_tUioaX-_Xs9Bq-V_\"><font color=\"#990000\">Wisconsin Institute for Discovery - Core Computational Technology</font></a></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px\"><font color=\"#999999\"><br></font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px\"><font color=\"#999999\">University of Wisconsin-Madison</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px\"><font color=\"#999999\">330 N Orchard St</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px\"><font color=\"#999999\">Madison, WI 53715</font></div><div style=\"font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:13.333333969116211px\"><a href=\"tel:%28608%29316-4430\" value=\"+16083164430\" style=\"color:rgb(17,85,204)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofol